{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be brave. Be smart. Don't let midnight be the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>PAPAO: The Legend of the Bogeyman</strong>, you are a child who ignored your parents' warnings and now faces terrifying consequences. When the legendary Bogeyman visits you, he delivers a chilling ultimatum: he will return at midnight to take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With time against you, it\u2019s time to act! Your mission is twofold: stop the Bogeyman from fulfilling his promise and uncover dark secrets that tie into your own fate. Face your deepest fears as you explore the monster's mysterious lair searching for answers. Tackle eerie challenges, solve hidden mysteries, and find the strength needed to defeat the fearsome Bogeyman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your destiny is not yours alone \u2014 it\u2019s in your hands to save children worldwide. Prepare yourself for an adventure full of suspense, courage, and surprising twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651710/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1745103450\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the monster's lair and prove you\u2019re not afraid of the Bogeyman!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use toys as weapons to defend yourself and overcome various challenging puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651710/extras/Cuc1.jpg?t=1745103450\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PAPAO: The Legend of the Bogeyman offers the option to disable blood textures, specially designed for more sensitive audiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PAPAO: The Legend of the Bogeyman is a pilot project created and developed by Apenas um Game!. We are constantly learning to improve, so we appreciate all criticism and praise. Enjoy the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651710?t=1745103450","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651710/7394a394c7e727aff2a14e253b3794d4ddc8c38c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745103450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651710/ded3b979e43a9fcf3a022b65b0042f17dbc98a3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745103450","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651710/ded3b979e43a9fcf3a022b65b0042f17dbc98a3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745103450","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be brave. Be smart. Don't let midnight be the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>PAPAO: The Legend of the Bogeyman</strong>, you are a child who ignored your parents' warnings and now faces terrifying consequences. When the legendary Bogeyman visits you, he delivers a chilling ultimatum: he will return at midnight to take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With time against you, it\u2019s time to act! Your mission is twofold: stop the Bogeyman from fulfilling his promise and uncover dark secrets that tie into your own fate. Face your deepest fears as you explore the monster's mysterious lair searching for answers. Tackle eerie challenges, solve hidden mysteries, and find the strength needed to defeat the fearsome Bogeyman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your destiny is not yours alone \u2014 it\u2019s in your hands to save children worldwide. Prepare yourself for an adventure full of suspense, courage, and surprising twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651710/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1745103450\" /></p><p 